{"title": "Paranoid Dreams (Condition)", "pageid": 45203, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Paranoid_Dreams_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Offensive Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Paranoid Dreams</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>When this Spectator is struck, it dreams in fear.</li>\n<li>After 5 Paranoid Dreams, it will spend a Legendary Action to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ocular_Nightmare\" title=\"Ocular Nightmare\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/25px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/38px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/50px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ocular Nightmare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp/25px-Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Ocular_Nightmare_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ocular_Nightmare\" title=\"Ocular Nightmare\">Ocular Nightmare</a>.</li>\n<li>If the Spectator uses one of its Eye Rays, it loses one Paranoid Dream. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LEGENDARYACTION_SPECTATOR_EYEBEAMNOVA_COUNTER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLEGENDARYACTION_SPECTATOR_EYEBEAMNOVA_COUNTER%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLEGENDARYACTION_SPECTATOR_EYEBEAMNOVA_COUNTER%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/TickingWithSource\" title=\"Status properties/TickingWithSource\">TickingWithSource</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Grenades do not increase the number of Paranoid Dreams.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Paranoid Dream increases if the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/25px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/38px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/50px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectator\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/25px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectator</a> is targeted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/38px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/50px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\">Mage Armour</a> cast by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dhourn\" title=\"Dhourn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png/25px-Portrait_Dhourn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png/38px-Portrait_Dhourn.png.webp 1.5x, /w